## 8. Recommended Title Options (Ranked)

1. **"Stop Compressing Your People: What AI Adoption Actually Demands of Your Talent Strategy"** — Provocative opening clause, clear stakes, positions against the dominant cost-reduction narrative. A VP or CTO reads this and immediately knows which side the article is on.

2. **"The Delegation Problem: Why Most AI Training Misses What Actually Changes at Work"** — Leads with the reframe that is most original to this transcript. Speaks directly to L&D and talent leaders. Slightly narrower audience.

3. **"What Happens to Your Best People When AI Takes the Compressible Work?"** — Creates tension through a question. Forces the reader to think about their own organization before reading a word. Slightly softer positioning.

